    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your ice cream business. Organize and upgrade your kitchen and inventories. Find new recipes and flavors, buy new ice-cream carts. Discover each location\u2019s favorite flavors and make customers happy.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/a80c859bd9f2c7665b851400da83f664.poster.avif?t=1754090840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/a80c859bd9f2c7665b851400da83f664.webm?t=1754090840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/a80c859bd9f2c7665b851400da83f664.mp4?t=1754090840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make And Sell Ice Creams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients. Start blending them and let it chill!. Plan your next staging correctly for your carts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/88274a4924c68d8104dc6857e980f35b.poster.avif?t=1754090840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/88274a4924c68d8104dc6857e980f35b.webm?t=1754090840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/88274a4924c68d8104dc6857e980f35b.mp4?t=1754090840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Learn new recipes and unlock special ones throughout your journey. Each flavor has a distinct category, each location has it\u2019s own flavor personality. Get to know the locals, understand their tastes, and create treats that bring smiles.<br>   </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your ice cream business. Organize and upgrade your kitchen and inventories. Find new recipes and flavors, buy new ice-cream carts. Discover each location\u2019s favorite flavors and make customers happy.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/a80c859bd9f2c7665b851400da83f664.poster.avif?t=1754090840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/a80c859bd9f2c7665b851400da83f664.webm?t=1754090840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/a80c859bd9f2c7665b851400da83f664.mp4?t=1754090840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make And Sell Ice Creams</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients. Start blending them and let it chill!. Plan your next staging correctly for your carts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/88274a4924c68d8104dc6857e980f35b.poster.avif?t=1754090840\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/88274a4924c68d8104dc6857e980f35b.webm?t=1754090840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174390/extras/88274a4924c68d8104dc6857e980f35b.mp4?t=1754090840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Learn new recipes and unlock special ones throughout your journey. Each flavor has a distinct category, each location has it\u2019s own flavor personality. Get to know the locals, understand their tastes, and create treats that bring smiles.<br>   </p>",
